\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/t%E1%BA%A7ng_ng%E1%BA%ADm_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"tầng ngậm nước\">tầng ngậm nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/th%C3%A1c_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"thác nước\">thác nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/tr%C3%A2u_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"trâu nước\">trâu nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/tr%E1%BB%A9ng_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"trứng nước\">trứng nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/t%E1%BB%A9c_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_v%E1%BB%A1_b%E1%BB%9D#Vietnamese\" title=\"tức nước vỡ bờ\">tức nước vỡ bờ</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/u%E1%BB%91ng_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_nh%E1%BB%9B_ngu%E1%BB%93n#Vietnamese\" title=\"uống nước nhớ nguồn\">uống nước nhớ nguồn</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/v%C3%B2i_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"vòi nước\">vòi nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/xu%E1%BB%91ng_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"xuống nước\">xuống nước</a></span></li></ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading5\"><h5 id=\"See_also\">See also</h5></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\">broth</span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span><span class=\"ib-colon sense-qualifier-colon\">:</span> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/c%C3%A1i#Vietnamese\" title=\"cái\">cái</a></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology_2\">Etymology 2</h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Noun_3\">Noun</h4></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\">nước</strong> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Vietnamese_transliteration\" title=\"Wiktionary:Vietnamese transliteration\">•</a> (<span lang=\"vi-Latn\" class=\"headword-tr tr Latn\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"Hani\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%83#Vietnamese\" title=\"渃\">渃</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%F0%AB%AD%94#Vietnamese\" title=\"𫭔\">𫭔</a></span></span>)</span> (<i>classifier</i> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/c%C3%A1i#Vietnamese\" title=\"cái\">cái</a></span>)&#32;\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\">short for <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C4%91%E1%BA%A5t_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"đất nước\">đất nước</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">country; polity</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></span></span>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"h-usage-example\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\"><b>nước</b> Mỹ</i> ― <span class=\"e-translation\">the United States</span></span></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><div class=\"citation-whole\"><span class=\"cited-source\"><b>19th century</b>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%A0_Huy%E1%BB%87n_Thanh_Quan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Bà Huyện Thanh Quan\">Bà Huyện Thanh Quan</a>, <cite><i>Qua đèo Ngang</i></cite> &#91;<cite><span class=\"e-translation\">Passing by the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ngang_Pass\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Ngang Pass\">Ngang Pass</a></span></cite>&#93;:</span><dl><dd><div class=\"h-quotation\"><span class=\"Hani e-quotation cited-passage\" lang=\"vi\">𢖵<b>渃</b>𤴬𢚸𡥵蟈蟈<br />傷茄痗𠰘丐𬷬𬷬</span><dl><dd><i lang=\"vi-Latn\" class=\"e-transliteration tr Latn\">Nhớ <b>nước</b>, đau lòng con <a href=\"/wiki/cu%E1%BB%91c\" title=\"cuốc\">cuốc</a> <a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9C%8B\" title=\"國\">cuốc</a>,<br />Thương <a href=\"/wiki/nh%C3%A0\" title=\"nhà\">nhà</a>, mỏi miệng cái <a href=\"/wiki/%C4%91a_%C4%91a\" title=\"đa đa\">da</a> <a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%B6\" title=\"家\">da</a>.</i></dd><dd><span class=\"e-translation\">Missing its <b>land</b>, a swamphen feels hurt deeply,<br />Longing for its home, a francolin's screaming desperately.</span></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></div></li></ul></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading5\"><h5 id=\"Derived_terms_2\">Derived terms</h5></div>\n<div class=\"list-switcher-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-switcher\" data-toggle-category=\"derived terms\"><div class=\"term-list columns-bg ul-column-count\" data-column-count=\"5\"><ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C4%91%E1%BA%A5t_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"đất nước\">đất nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/h%E1%BB%93n_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"hồn nước\">hồn nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/nh%C3%A0_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"nhà nước\">nhà nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/non_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"non nước\">non nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_m%E1%BA%B9#Vietnamese\" title=\"nước mẹ\">nước mẹ</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_ngo%C3%A0i#Vietnamese\" title=\"nước ngoài\">nước ngoài</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_nh%C3%A0#Vietnamese\" title=\"nước nhà\">nước nhà</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_non#Vietnamese\" title=\"nước non\">nước non</a></span></li></ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology_3\">Etymology 3</h3></div>\n<p>Possible <a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#doublet\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">doublet</a> of <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/b%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"bước\">bước</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">to step</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Noun_4\">Noun</h4></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\">nước</strong> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Vietnamese_transliteration\" title=\"Wiktionary:Vietnamese transliteration\">•</a> (<span lang=\"vi-Latn\" class=\"headword-tr tr Latn\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"Hani\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%97#Vietnamese\" title=\"著\">著</a></span></span>)</span> (<i>classifier</i> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/c%C3%A1i#Vietnamese\" title=\"cái\">cái</a></span>)&#32;\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\">chiefly in&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/board_game\" title=\"board game\">board games</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/move\" title=\"move\">move</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/step\" title=\"step\">step</a>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"h-usage-example\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\"><b>nước</b> cờ khôn ngoan</i> ― <span class=\"e-translation\">a wise move</span></span></dd></dl></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading5\"><h5 id=\"Derived_terms_3\">Derived terms</h5></div>\n<div class=\"list-switcher-wrapper\"><div class=\"term-list columns-bg\"><ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/ch%E1%BA%A1y_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_r%C3%BAt#Vietnamese\" title=\"chạy nước rút\">chạy nước rút</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/m%C3%A1ch_n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"mách nước\">mách nước</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc_b%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc#Vietnamese\" title=\"nước bước\">nước bước</a></span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
    "wikitext": "{{also|nuoc}}\n==Middle Vietnamese==\n\n===Alternative forms===\n* {{alt|mkh-mvi|nác}}\n\n===Etymology===\nFrom {{inh|mkh-mvi|mkh-vie-pro|*ɗaːk||water}}, from {{inh|mkh-mvi|mkh-pro|*ɗaak||water}}.\n\n===Noun===\n{{head|mkh-mvi|noun}}\n\n# [[water]]\n# [[country]]\n\n====Descendants====\n* {{desc|vi|nước}}\n\n===References===\n* {{R:VBL}}\n\n==Vietnamese==\n\n===Pronunciation===\n{{vi-IPA}}\n* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-nước.wav|a=Hanoi}}\n\n===Etymology 1===\nFrom {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*ɗaːk||water}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*ɗaːkʔ||water}}. Cognates with Nghệ An/Hà Tĩnh dialects {{m|vi|nác}}, {{cog|mtq|đác}}, {{cog|nuo|đác}}, {{cog|km|ទឹក|tr=tik}}, {{cog|bdq|đak}}, {{cog|mng|dak}}, {{cog|ncb|râk}}/{{m|ncb|dâk}}, {{cog|sat|ᱫᱟᱜ}}.\n\nThe sense of \"country\" is attested already in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經), where the term was spelled as {{m|vi|渃}}. Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|nước}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).\n\n====Alternative forms====\n* {{alt|vi|nác|q=North Central Vietnam|pos=no diphthongization}}\n\n====Noun====\n{{vi-noun|[[渃]]}}\n\n# [[water]]\n#* {{quote-journal|vi|title=Nước bẩn lấy máu mà rửa!|date=15 June 2016|url=https://tuoitre.vn/nuoc-ban-lay-mau-ma-rua-1118443.htm|newspaper=Tuổi Trẻ Online|passage=Vua hỏi: tay bẩn thì lấy '''nước''' để rửa, rứa '''nước''' bẩn lấy chi mà rửa? Ông quan thị vệ hoảng hốt, không biết trả lời thế nào. Vua liền nhấn giọng: “'''Nước''' bẩn thì lấy máu mà rửa!”.|translation=The emperor ({{w|Duy Tân}}) asked: “If your hands are dirty, you would wash them with '''water'''. But if the '''water''' ({{=}} '''country''') is dirty, what would you wash it with?” The flustered court officials could not answer. The emperor then raised his voice: “If the '''water''' / '''country''' is dirty, you should wash it with blood!”}}\n# [[liquid]]; [[fluid]]\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' cam|orange '''juice'''}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' chanh|lime '''juice'''}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' dừa|coconut '''water'''}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' mắt|tear}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' mũi|mucus}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' đái|piss}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' tiểu|urine}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' xô-đa|soda '''water'''}}\n#* {{quote-song|vi|author={{w|lang=vi|Hoài An (nhạc sĩ sinh 1977)|Hoài An}}|title=Dòng sông băng|text=Nếu có '''nước''' mắt, nếu có yêu thương,<br>Mênh mông dòng sông thì thầm cùng em.|t=If there are tears, if there’s love,<br>The vast river will whisper with you.|trans-title=Icy River}}\n# the [[liquid]] part of a [[broth]]\n#: {{synonyms|vi|nước dùng|nước lèo}}\n\n=====Derived terms=====\n{{col5|vi|bóng nước|cá nước|cây nước|con nước|còn nước còn tát|cơm nước|dừa nước|đầu nước|gà nước|hết nước|khoai nước|làng nước|lên nước|lúa nước|máy nước|mặt nước|mớn nước|ngã nước|ngậm nước|nước bọt|nước chanh|nước chấm|nước chảy đá mòn|nước chè|nước cống|nước cốt dừa|nước cứng|nước da|nước dãi|nước dùng|nước đá|nước đại|nước độc|nước đôi|nước đục|nước đục thả câu|nước đường|nước ép|nước gạo|nước giải|nước giải khát|nước hàng|nước hoa|nước khoáng|nước kiệu|nước lã|nước lèo|nước lên|nước lọc|nước máy|nước mắm|nước mắt|nước mắt cá sấu|nước mía|nước miếng|nước mũi|nước nặng|nước ngọt|nước nôi|nước ối|nước ròng|nước tiểu|nước tương|nước xáo|nước xốt|nước xuýt|phá nước|rắn nước|sạch nước cản|tầng ngậm nước|trâu nước|trứng nước|tức nước vỡ bờ|vòi nước|nước suối|xuống nước|thác nước|chuối nước|nước đái|nước cất|nước tro|nước uống|nước mặn|háo nước|kị nước|nước trắng|Nước Trời|Nước Thiên Chúa|mỡ nước|như cá gặp nước|uống nước nhớ nguồn}}\n\n=====See also=====\n* {{s|broth}} {{vi-l|cái}}\n\n===Etymology 2===\n\n====Noun====\n{{vi-noun|[[渃]], [[𫭔]]|cls=cái}}\n\n# {{short for|vi|đất nước||country; polity}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' Mỹ|the United States}}\n#* {{quote-book|vi|year=19th century|author={{w|Bà Huyện Thanh Quan}}|title=''Qua đèo Ngang''|trans-title=Passing by the {{w|Ngang Pass}}|passage=𢖵'''渃'''𤴬𢚸𡥵蟈蟈</br>傷茄痗𠰘丐𬷬𬷬|transliteration=Nhớ '''nước''', đau lòng con [[cuốc]] [[國|cuốc]],<br>Thương [[nhà]], mỏi miệng cái [[đa đa|da]] [[家|da]].|translation=Missing its '''land''', a swamphen feels hurt deeply,<br>Longing for its home, a francolin's screaming desperately.}}\n\n=====Derived terms=====\n{{col5|vi|đất nước|hồn nước|nhà nước|non nước|nước mẹ|nước ngoài|nước nhà|nước non|}}\n\n===Etymology 3===\nPossible {{doublet|vi|bước|t1=to step|nocap=y}}.\n\n====Noun====\n{{vi-noun|著|cls=cái}}\n\n# {{lb|vi|chiefly in|_|board games}} [[move]], [[step]]\n#: {{uxi|vi|'''nước''' cờ khôn ngoan|a wise move}}\n\n=====Derived terms=====\n{{col3|vi|nước bước|chạy nước rút|mách nước}}\n\n{{C|vi|Alchemy|Water}}"
  }
